  "pseudocode": "1. Initialize left=0, maxLength=0, map={}\n2. Loop right from 0 to s.length-1\n3. If s[right] in map and map[s[right]] >= left, update left = map[s[right]] + 1\n4. Update map[s[right]] = right\n5. Update maxLength = max(maxLength, right - left + 1)\n6. Return maxLength",
